---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Study Hub"
  description="Learn what Study Hub collects, how learning tools and contributions are handled, and what third-party services may receive."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-page-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy and data use</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>This policy explains how Study Hub handles information when you browse learning resources, use the document reader, send a suggestion, or offer a resource.</p>
      <p class="policy-updated">Last updated <time datetime="2026-10-10">October 10, 2026</time></p>
    </header>

    <article class="legal-copy">
      <section>
        <h2>About this policy</h2>
        <p>Study Hub is an educational resource website for learners, with a focus on Ugandan secondary-school study. You can browse public pages and resources without creating a Study Hub account. This policy describes the current website; it will be revised if the services or providers change.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
        <p>The suggestions page does not ask for your name or email address. Suggestions are reviewed before they may appear publicly, so do not include private, identifying, or sensitive information in a suggestion.</p>
        <p>If you offer a study resource, the site receives the file and the details you provide for review. Submissions are held for moderation and are not published automatically. Only submit material you are permitted to share. The review team may retain, decline, or remove a submission as needed to manage the library.</p>
        <p>For questions or removal requests, email <a href="mailto:trusteth777@gmail.com">Study Hub</a>. Include enough information to identify the relevant page or submission, but do not send passwords or other sensitive information.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Document reader and AI study companion</h2>
        <p>The reader can keep bookmarks, reading preferences, and limited information needed to resume a contribution in your browser. These features use browser storage on the device you are using; clearing the site’s browser data may remove them.</p>
        <p>If you use the AI study companion, the current PDF page image, your question, and recent conversation context are sent to Study Hub’s AI service and an external generative AI provider to produce an answer. The reader keeps the conversation in the open page and does not require an account. Avoid sending personal, confidential, or sensitive information. AI responses may be inaccurate and should be checked against trusted learning materials.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Technical information and service providers</h2>
        <p>When your browser connects to a website or service, technical information such as your IP address, device, browser, and request details may be processed by the relevant provider. Study Hub uses GitHub Pages to serve the website, Supabase for the resource catalog and contribution services, Cloudflare Turnstile to help protect forms from automated abuse, and Google Gemini to generate AI study responses. The PDF page and question are sent to the AI service only when you submit a request. Each provider processes information under its own terms and privacy notice.</p>
        <p>Study Hub’s standard page layouts request fonts from Google Fonts. Some learning pages also embed or link to YouTube. When your browser loads these services, the relevant provider may receive connection information and may use its own cookies or similar technologies. You can choose not to open external videos or use the AI tool.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Cookies, advertising, and analytics</h2>
        <p>Study Hub does not currently use Google AdSense. When advertising is introduced, this policy and any required notices or consent controls will be updated before ads are enabled. Third-party services embedded or used by the site may use cookies or similar technologies under their own policies.</p>
        <p>The current site does not require an advertising profile or sign-in to browse its public learning materials. Browser storage used by reader features is described above.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How long information is kept</h2>
        <p>Suggestions and resource submissions are kept as needed to review and operate the library. Technical records may be retained by the hosting or service providers for their operational and security purposes. Retention periods can vary by service and record type; contact Study Hub with a specific question or request.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy when the site’s features or service providers change. The date above indicates the latest revision. For privacy questions or requests, contact <a href="mailto:trusteth777@gmail.com">trusteth777@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
